      en: ["Buxton is located 16 km from Georgetown.", "Population approximately 4,500 (2020).", "Founded around 1840.", "Area is about 5.1 km².", "Average elevation is 1 meter above sea level.", "Named after Thomas Fowell Buxton (1786-1845)."],
