      en: ["Location of the largest sugar cane estate in Guyana.", "The Albion Ground hosted the first-ever ODI cricket match in the Caribbean.", "Produces a significant portion of Guyana's sugar output.", "Houses the GuySuCo Apprentice Training Centre.", "A major cultural hub for the Indo-Guyanese community.", "Features one of the most modern sugar factories in the country."],
